OL,3,GNEWSA'Be the loudest fans that have
OL,4,Aever been at Old Trafford'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter booking their place in their
OL,7,Ffirst Super League Grand Final with a
OL,8,Fsensational upset against Wigan
OL,9,FWarriors, Wakefield Trinity now have a
OL,10,Fshot at rugby league immortality. As
OL,11,Ffans prepare to head across the
OL,12,FPennines for Saturday's final, they say
OL,13,Fyou can "feel the buzz everywhere you
OL,14,Fgo".
OL,16,FPicking out a new shirt in the club
OL,17,Fshop, lifelong fan Lisa Maskill shows
OL,18,Foff her Trinity-inspired nails painted
OL,19,Fred, white and blue.
OL,21,F"Everyone in Wakefield is just
OL,22,Fuplifted," she says.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
